 part of a article from Wikipedia has been used as corpus and was tested against different type of questions that the program can answer correctly. Advanced QA requires sophisticated text processing tools based on state-of-the-art NLP.","topics":[],"score":228676,"global_rank":112058},{"name":"Zach076/HouseholdProcessor","owner":"Zach076","html_url":"https://github.com/Zach076/HouseholdProcessor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":228672,"global_rank":112098},{"name":"lanselylee/pokemon-collection-app","owner":"lanselylee","html_url":"https://github.com/lanselylee/pokemon-collection-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Personal extended version of Pok\u00e9mon Collection Management System (CS5004 Final Project).","topics":[],"score":228672,"global_rank":112107},{"name":"samarth-29/SpringMVC-webservice","owner":"samarth-29","html_url":"https://github.com/samarth-29/SpringMVC-webservice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":228669,"global_rank":112121},{"name":"jmacfawn/CSC142WeddingPlanner","owner":"jmacfawn","html_url":"https://github.com/jmacfawn/CSC142WeddingPlanner","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Wedding planner project for CSC 142","topics":[],"score":228631,"global_rank":112161},{"name":"dfuenzalida/SpringBootOpenHtmlToPdfDemo","owner":"dfuenzalida","html_url":"https://github.com/dfuenzalida/SpringBootOpenHtmlToPdfDemo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":228617,"global_rank":112208},{"name":"DinoChiesa/ApigeeEdge-Java-Compute-Hash","owner":"DinoChiesa","html_url":"https://github.com/DinoChiesa/ApigeeEdge-Java-Compute-Hash","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"computes and verifies hashes on arbitrary content in an Apigee Edge proxy","topics